<title>USA: Pharmos names president.</title>
<headline>Pharmos names president.</headline>
<dateline>ALACHUA, Fla 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biopharmaceutical company Pharmos Corp said Friday it had named Gadi Riesenfeld as president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Riesenfeld, who served as executive vice president and chief operating officer, will replace Haim Aviv as president, it said.</p>
<p>Aviv, the company's chairman and chief executive officer, was acting president for at least a year, a company official said.</p>
<p>Pharmos makes proprietary products to treat ophthalmic and neurologic disorders.</p>
